# Line endings are fixed here so that editors on Windows, Obsidian among
# them, cannot turn a saved file into a diff that changes nothing.
# Text files are stored and checked out with LF; git no longer converts
# anything on the way in or out, whatever core.autocrlf says locally.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Captures and figures must never be touched by any conversion.
*.npz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
